{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10454","headline":"平台夜遇李景参有别 · 高适","name":"平台夜遇李景参有别","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"离心忽怅然，策马对秋天。\n孟诸薄暮凉风起，归客相逢渡睢水。\n昨时携手已十年，今日分途各千里。\n岁物萧条满路岐，此行浩荡令人悲。\n家贫羡尔有微禄，欲往从之何所之。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10454.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10454","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}